{{2026 BWF World Championships}}

The Women's doubles tournament of the [[2026 BWF World Championships]] took place from 17 to 23 August 2026 at the [[Indira Gandhi Arena]] in [[New Delhi]].<ref name="0:">{{cite web|title=BWF World Championships 2026 Invitation Letter|url=https://extranet.bwf.sport/docs/events/5565/docs/WCH2026NewDehli_Invitation%20Letter_14Jul2027.pdf|website=BWF Corporate|publisher=[[Badminton World Federation]]|language=en|format=PDF|date=14 July 2026|access-date=6 August 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260731060657/https://extranet.bwf.sport/docs/events/5565/docs/WCH2026NewDehli_Invitation%20Letter_14Jul2027.pdf|archive-date=31 July 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=BWF World Championships 2026 Schedule|url=https://extranet.bwf.sport/docs/events/5565/docs/World%20Champs%202026%20schedule%20for%20website.pdf|website=BWF Corporate|publisher=[[Badminton World Federation]]|language=en|format=PDF|year=2026|access-date=6 August 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260615015349/https://extranet.bwf.sport/docs/events/5565/docs/World%20Champs%202026%20schedule%20for%20website.pdf|archive-date=15 June 2026}}</ref>

